---
import { cx, layout, tokens, typography } from '../../utils/theme';
---
<section class="px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 pt-6 sm:pt-8 lg:pt-10 pb-8 sm:pb-10 lg:pb-14 bg-white overflow-hidden border-b border-[#f5f5f5]">
      <div class={cx(layout.compactShell, 'relative z-10')}>
        <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-7 sm:mb-10 lg:mb-16" data-reveal>
          <h2 class={cx(typography.vercelSection, 'text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-8')}>
            Our team <br />
            <span class="text-black/40">focused on delivery, accountable on quality.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class={cx(
            'max-w-5xl mx-auto p-5 sm:p-7 lg:p-10 bg-white border border-black/[0.18]',
            tokens.radiusCard
          )} data-reveal style={{ boxShadow: tokens.shadowStandard }}>
          <p class="text-[16px] text-black/80 leading-[1.65] sm:leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Reframe Visuals is run by a focused team of editors, quality reviewers, and client coordinators.
            We don&apos;t list names because we believe our work should speak, but every project has a dedicated
            editor and a QA reviewer before delivery.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] text-black/80 leading-[1.65] sm:leading-relaxed font-normal">
            When you contact us, you&apos;ll hear back within 30 minutes. When something isn&apos;t right, we fix it:
            no forms, no back-and-forth, just a direct reply.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/[0.18] bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm">
              <p class="mb-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-black/50">Response SLA</p>
              <p class="text-[16px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Within 30 minutes</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/[0.18] bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm">
              <p class="mb-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-black/50">Workflow</p>
              <p class="text-[16px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Dedicated editor + QA reviewer</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/[0.18] bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm">
              <p class="mb-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-black/50">Revision Process</p>
              <p class="text-[16px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Direct reply, fast resolution</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
